    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats escompt&#xE9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xE9;sultats escompt&#xE9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) l&apos;augmentation de la participation des Syriens du nord-est de la Syrie dans la d&#xE9;termination, la communication et la prise en mains de leurs besoins locaux en mati&#xE8;re de s&#xE9;curit&#xE9;?; 2) l&apos;am&#xE9;lioration de la capacit&#xE9; des FSI &#xE0; planifier et &#xE0; fournir des services de police inclusifs conformes aux principes et aux pratiques des services de police communautaires.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes of this project include: (1) increased engagement of Syrians across northeast Syria in identifying, communicating and addressing their local security needs; and (2) improved capacity of the ISF to plan and deliver inclusive policing services in line with community policing principles and practices.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
